00:16:40.459 --> 00:16:43.040
is you finish kindergarten,
you go to grade school.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.067
Finish grade school, go to junior high.

00:16:44.067 --> 00:16:46.136
Finish junior high, go to high school.

00:16:46.136 --> 00:16:48.312
Theoretically, go to college,
get a job, get promoted,

00:16:48.312 --> 00:16:51.056
retire and then the end is you die

00:16:51.056 --> 00:16:53.723
and yeah, there is no completion

00:16:54.952 --> 00:16:55.785
because you have to understand.

00:16:55.785 --> 00:16:58.273
In the world, sort of like
a simple way of putting it,

00:16:58.273 --> 00:17:00.523
very simple, overly simple,

00:17:02.119 --> 00:17:04.535
there's the wolves and the sheep, okay?

00:17:04.535 --> 00:17:06.541
Again, it's a very overly
simple way of putting it.

